meta {
  name: getDenormalizedEtimData
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

post {
  url: https://{{customer}}.{{domain}}/jsonrpc
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "getDenormalizedEtimData",
    "params": {
      "include_languages": [
        "nl"
      ],
      "etim_release": [
        "ETIM-10.0"
      ],
      "limit": 2
    },
    "id": 1
  }
}

docs {
  Retrieve denormalized ETIM classification data for bulk export

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |---|---|---|---|
  | `page` | integer | no | Page number (1-based) |
  | `limit` | integer | no | Maximum number of results per page (1–1000) |
  | `include_languages` | string[] | yes | Language codes to include (e.g. ["nl", "fr"]); at least one required |
  | `include_feature_types` | string[] (nullable) | no | Only include ETIM feature types: A (alphanumeric), L (logical), N (numeric), R (range) |
  | `etim_class_code` | string[] (nullable) | no | Filter by ETIM class codes (e.g. ["EC000001", "MC000001"]) |
  | `etim_release` | string[] (nullable) | no | Filter by ETIM release codes (e.g. ["EC9.0"]) |

  **Example: ETIM features for products**. include_languages is required.

  ```json
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "getDenormalizedEtimData",
    "params": {
      "include_languages": [
        "nl"
      ],
      "etim_release": [
        "ETIM-10.0"
      ],
      "limit": 2
    },
    "id": 1
  }
  ```

  Result:

  ```json
  {
    "etim_class_data": [
      {
        "language": "nl",
        "etim_class_code": "EC002713",
        "etim_class_description": "Ledlamp",
        "etim_feature_code": "EF000003",
        "etim_feature_type": "A",
        "etim_feature_description": "Montagewijze",
        "etim_value_code": "EV000030",
        "etim_value_description": "Opbouw"
      }
    ],
    "page": {
      "number_of_items": 1,
      "items_per_page": 2,
      "number_of_pages": 1,
      "current_page": 1
    }
  }
  ```
}
